+ * that failure mode and why this file is now the only place these three
+ * capabilities live).
+ *
+ * Defaults to poll-only at every boot, selected via debugfs
+ * (ns2009_qualification/mode - one of "poll-only" / "irq-observe" /
+ * "irq-assist"):
+ *
+ *   poll-only   - byte-for-byte identical to the original, unmodified
+ *                 30ms poll path below (ns2009_ts_report()/ns2009_ts_poll()
